;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "My_life_Without_Your_Love.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島の部屋.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>While we were in the bath, <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> had washed our clothes and even dried them in her state-of-the-art washing machine.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We were putting her to more trouble than I'd expected.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\超炭酸.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"The newest washers sure are fast! Sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, for putting you to all this trouble."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> thanked her while gulping down a Super Soda Bomber.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島ツインテールバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Not at all! My clothes probably wouldn't fit you anyway."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"And anyway, why've you got your hair in twin tails again?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ehehe! That </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> from earlier reacted so nicely, I thought I'd get a little carried away!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\インターホン.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "800" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
At the sound of the intercom, <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> and I tensed up.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh, it's here, it's here!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> ran off to the front door, paying no attention to the two of us frozen stiff.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Wonder who it is..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Was it that <STYLE ID="3">lolicon detective</STYLE> again?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "800" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
Before long, we heard <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>'s footsteps.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島ツインテールバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Sorry to keep you! Sakura Sushi's premium set, at your service!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> appeared carrying a big <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="すしおけ">sushi tub</STYLE>.<PG>
{PLAYSND "日常.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey now, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... Sakura Sushi's premium set? Something that expensive..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Please, don't worry about it! It's not like I get to eat this any other time!"</STYLE>
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "52" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\寿司.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,アイテム1,人物2,アイテム2" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"But if the cops are staking the place out, ordering this much sushi would look weird―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Let's eeeat!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> started with the sea-urchin gunkan. [TN: gunkan: 'battleship' sushi, rice wrapped in seaweed with topping.]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
True, <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> had a point, but from the way <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> was acting, she must have had some plan.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">―</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> had livened up the mood in the bath, and maybe thanks to that, <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>, who had looked so uneasy, was eating heartily too.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島の部屋.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"That's Sakura Sushi for you! Even the cucumber rolls are on another level!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島ツインテール挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh, there's one ikura left! Goto will take it!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hold it! Let your senpai have that! I haven't had any ikura yet!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you've got some nerve! I've only had one too!?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "death_sound1.ogg" "BGM2" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Ikura...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\いくら.lcm" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Its name meaning 'fish eggs' in Russian: <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="サケ">salmon</STYLE> roe marinated in soy sauce.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The eggs not of the 'shake,' but of the 'sake.' [TN: 'shake' and 'sake' are two readings of the word for salmon.]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At times a garnet. At times a rubellite.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And at other times, like a ruby, a jewel of the sea giving off a red glow.<PG>
When it comes to ikura, even I can't give it up so easily.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
After all, I've only eaten six pieces of ikura sushi so far.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM2" "0" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Mine!"</STYLE>
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\食べるアニメ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島の部屋.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島ツインテールバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Mmm! Ikura's the beeest!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "ごろごろゲームする日_2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Ahh, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, no fair! That's why your figure is just like you look!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s right! </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, go on a diet!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They're really bringing that up again...!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島ツインテール挨拶バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"No, no, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">! </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> doesn't have any extra meat on her!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Not the meat she needs either, though!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Rrgh...!
{PLAYSND "SE\kan_ge_kieda_oru02.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My right hand clenched, and the disposable chopsticks crumpled into a ball in my grip.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Now, now, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, there've gotta be guys who like girls as modest as </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Grrr...! To have the thing I'm most self-conscious about thrown at me this much!<PG>
{MESOFF "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\きらーん.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\風神.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\雷神.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "12" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Something descended inside me.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "Attack頭.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\寿司.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Yeah, yeah, that's right! Compared to you two, I've got a scrawny body that doesn't stick out where it should and sticks out where it shouldn't!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　That does it! Sushi, hear me! Become my chest!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\食べるアニメ.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
I recklessly stuffed the rest of the sushi into my mouth.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, no hogging!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Damn, you're on!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The two of them followed suit and started stuffing in sushi too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In that case, all this premium stuff I hardly ever get to eat is mine!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Whoever eats the most wins!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Or so I thought, but after being told all that, I was most gravely displeased.<PG>
{STOPSND "SE" "300" "PASS"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\わさび.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
While the two were busy <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="そしゃく">chewing</STYLE>, I reached for the wasabi served on the side.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Sakura Sushi is a genuine high-class sushi restaurant.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The wasabi they use is fresh, top-grade wasabi from Azumino in Nagano Prefecture.<PG>
A chef grates it carefully, carefully, on a <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="さめはだ">sharkskin grater</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even a small amount packs a heat and a smell that are no joke.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\手直し・追加\死刑台.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka Niimura</STYLE>... my <STYLE ID="2">best friend</STYLE>... curse your taste buds that can't handle spicy food...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島ツインテールバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Erina Goto</STYLE>... my <STYLE ID="1">cute junior</STYLE>... thank you truly for everything up to today...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\寿司.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Now's my chance...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The moment the two took their eyes off the <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="すしおけ">sushi tub</STYLE>, I loaded two pieces of sushi with a huge amount of wasabi.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\食べるアニメ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\食べるアニメ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
And then, never noticing, the two of them grabbed the wasabi sushi at the same moment and crammed each into their mouths in one bite.<PG>
{DELETECG "000" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
